{"batch": "B07", "bytes": 152107, "cf": "h", "ch": "C04", "cue_gap": true, "cues": [95], "fail": "The bullish engulfing bar did not start a bull reversal: after a short pause the market sold off, bounced weakly to a lower high, then fell in lower highs and lower lows to a new low at the right edge.", "file": "frame_000437.jpg", "group": "G0055", "h": 1080, "kind": "keyframe", "mk": {"blue_arrow": 1, "blue_text": 1, "red_box": 7, "text": 2}, "path": "高清原始分辨率/frame_000437.jpg", "pp": {"post": "Two small bear bars, a pink-boxed bear bar and a drop to x~860-880 (low just above the bull bar's tail); a weak rally to a lower high near x~1122; then lower highs with pink-boxed sell bars and a new low at the right edge (x~1875, y~925).", "pre": "Bars to its left: spike high, two big bear bars, a tight bear channel, then a tight trading range at the low; the bull bar has a long lower tail and closes near the top of that range after little prior buying (the slide's red list: bear trend, top of TTR, not much buying pressure).", "ref": "big bull engulfing bar at x~777"}, "read": true, "read_via": "Read tool on the full original JPG (restored/zip/<path>)", "rec_utc": "2026-10-23T17:48:53+00:00", "sc": "chart", "see": "Continuation at full contrast; otherwise as frame 436 (fade order 433-437 confirmed with a pixel-darkness check). No pointer.", "seq": 437, "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_018Eo48yx51h6bVGv1A5dkzQ", "sha256": "a011c0b1545bbb9cf8df630b986e1b974ab5f4b720bb22f99ad3f40c61ea266d", "t": 350.1, "w": 1920}
